hub.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in latest master\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev (1c8cc9e7e) - Ubuntu 24.04.2 LTS 24.04 on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6600 (RADV NAVI23) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 15.51 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen editing a tool script with an external editor (in my case VSCode), if you hover over `@export_storage`  Godot will go to an infinite loop in `GDScriptWorkspace::find_usages_in_file`.\n\nI triaged this to happen when the new character is selected in the while loop:\n\n```\n(NOTE: 474 is line 472 in master here)\n(gdb) break modules/gdscript/language_server/gdscript_workspace.cpp:474\nBreakpoint 1 at 0x5555567895c9: file ./modules/gdscript/language_server/gdscript_workspace.cpp, line 474.\n(gdb) c\nContinuing.\n\nThread 1 \"godot.linuxbsd.\" hit Breakpoint 1, GDScriptWorkspace::find_usages_in_file (this=0x555564120180, p_symbol=..., p_file_path=...)\n    at ./modules/gdscript/language_server/gdscript_workspace.cpp:474\n474\t\t\t\t\tcharacter = line.find(identifier, range.end.character);\n(gdb) display character\n1: character = 0\n(gdb) display range.end.character\n2: range.end.character = 0\n(gdb) c\nContinuing.\n\nThread 1 \"godot.linuxbsd.\" hit Breakpoint 1, GDScriptWorkspace::find_usages_in_file (this=0x555564120180, p_symbol=..., p_file_path=...)\n    at ./modules/gdscript/language_server/gdscript_workspace.cpp:474\n474\t\t\t\t\tcharacter = line.find(identifier, range.end.character);\n1: character = 0\n2: range.end.character = 0\n(gdb) c\nContinuing.\n\nThread 1 \"godot.linuxbsd.\" hit Breakpoint 1, GDScriptWorkspace::find_usages_in_file (this=0x555564120180, p_symbol=..., p_file_path=...)\n    at ./modules/gdscript/language_server/gdscript_workspace.cpp:474\n474\t\t\t\t\tcharacter = line.find(identifier, range.end.character);\n1: character = 0\n2: range.end.character = 0\n(gdb) c\nContinuing.\n\nThread 1 \"godot.linuxbsd.\" hit Breakpoint 1, GDScriptWorkspace::find_usages_in_file (this=0x555564120180, p_symbol=..., p_file_path=...)\n    at ./modules/gdscript/language_server/gdscript_workspace.cpp:474\n474\t\t\t\t\tcharacter = line.find(identifier, range.end.character);\n1: character = 0\n2: range.end.character = 0\n``` \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI've included an MRP. Open the tool.gd in VSCode while the editor is open (and make sure godot extension is connected). Hover over `@export_storage` keyword a few times and observe a hang.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[lsp-infinite-loop-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27048252/lsp-infinite-loop-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","us